<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <title>US8765023B2 - Composition for preparing separator, method for preparing separator, and electrochemical device having separator prepared therefrom 
        - Google Patents</title>

    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="referrer" content="origin-when-crossorigin">
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://patents.google.com/patent/US8765023B2/en">
    <meta name="description" content="
     The present invention relates to a composition for preparing a separator for an electrochemical device, a method preparing a separator for an electrochemical device, and an electrochemical device having a separator prepared therefrom, more particularly, a composition for preparing a separator for an electrochemical device, comprising a polyolefin, a first diluent, and a second diluent, wherein an interaction energy between the first diluent and the second diluent is in the range of 2 to 3.5 cal/cm 3 , a method preparing a separator for an electrochemical device using the composition, and an electrochemical device having a separator prepared therefrom. In accordance with the present invention, the pore size of a polyolefin separator can be suitably controlled into a size desired by a user, and the high-temperature stability and mechanical property of the separator can be remarkably improved, thereby enhancing the life time and stability of an electrochemical device having the same. 
   
   ">
    <meta name="DC.type" content="patent">
    <meta name="DC.title" content="Composition for preparing separator, method for preparing separator, and electrochemical device having separator prepared therefrom 
       ">
    <meta name="DC.date" content="2013-06-28" scheme="dateSubmitted">
    <meta name="DC.description" content="
     The present invention relates to a composition for preparing a separator for an electrochemical device, a method preparing a separator for an electrochemical device, and an electrochemical device having a separator prepared therefrom, more particularly, a composition for preparing a separator for an electrochemical device, comprising a polyolefin, a first diluent, and a second diluent, wherein an interaction energy between the first diluent and the second diluent is in the range of 2 to 3.5 cal/cm 3 , a method preparing a separator for an electrochemical device using the composition, and an electrochemical device having a separator prepared therefrom. In accordance with the present invention, the pore size of a polyolefin separator can be suitably controlled into a size desired by a user, and the high-temperature stability and mechanical property of the separator can be remarkably improved, thereby enhancing the life time and stability of an electrochemical device having the same. 
   
   ">
