      <div num="p-0049" class="description-paragraph"> <figref idrefs="DRAWINGS">FIG. 29</figref> shows the measurements of a phase separation temperature for blends of polyethylene//(dioctyl phthalate/poly(tetramethylene ether) glycol (PTMG) (650)=30/70) depending on the content of PTMG.</div>
      <div num="p-0050" class="description-paragraph"> <figref idrefs="DRAWINGS">FIG. 30</figref> shows the size and morphology of droplets for each of the following blends: (a) a blend of polyethylene//(poly(tetramethylene ether) glycol (650)/dioctyl phthalate=2.5/97.5)=30//70, (b) a blend of polyethylene//(poly(tetramethylene ether) glycol (650)/dioctyl phthalate=5/95)=30//70, (c) a blend of polyethylene//(poly(tetramethylene ether) glycol (650)/dioctyl phthalate=10/90)=30//70, and (d) a blend of polyethylene//(poly(tetramethylene ether) glycol (650)/dioctyl phthalate=15/85)=30//70.</div>
